# The vendored Sackmann corpus is pinned to LF line endings so the bytes match
# upstream (JeffSackmann/tennis_{atp,wta} serve LF) regardless of host OS. This
# keeps `scripts/vendor_sackmann_corpus.py` idempotent: a re-vendor on Windows,
# Linux, or macOS reproduces the same blob instead of an ~80k-line CRLF<->LF diff.
*.csv text eol=lf
